stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> EMPTY : Entry Created

    EMPTY --> PARTIAL : First File Uploaded

    state ConsistencyCheck <<choice>>

    PARTIAL --> ConsistencyCheck : File Uploaded/Removed
    COMPLIANT --> ConsistencyCheck : File Removed

    ConsistencyCheck --> COMPLIANT : "Rules Satisfied (All Mandatory Slots Full)"
    ConsistencyCheck --> PARTIAL : "Rules Unsatisfied (Missing Mandatory Slot)"

    COMPLIANT --> LOCKED : Year Closed / Exported
    PARTIAL --> LOCKED : "Year Closed (Warning Logged)"

    LOCKED --> [*]